1. Purpose

Test the ODESolvers thorn.

test-rk4-2, test-rk4-3, test-rk42-imex, test-rk42-imex2l, and test-imex32l
integrate y' = y, y' = -y, and y' = y - y/2 on one cell. The run aborts
if the absolute error exceeds the bound in the parameter file. The older
tests keep their one-step output and leave that check off.
